abstract: "Cipher Court is an open measurement protocol and playable calibration instrument for studying human confidence, replay verification, and adversarial evidence. The protocol includes an open telemetry schema, aggregation and privacy boundary, preregistration scaffold, scam susceptibility transfer study, adaptive Noise Agent design, and replay-sovereign calibration doctrine."
